        "text": "<@UGWUJUZHT> have you ever heard of <https://www.cl.cam.ac.uk/techreports/UCAM-CL-TR-580.pdf%7C|bigraphs>? They are the culmination of Robin Milner's work on process calculi, which are the more mathematical/algebraic alternative to the Actor Model. The way Milner draws bigraphs is quite similar to your diagrams, and they are also motivated by applications to distributed computing.",
